1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,207
They had published every exemption and still lost the room; now the only question left was what each of them would choose.

2
00:00:07,207 --> 00:00:16,470
The tenth arc began in a museum of urban history, where the choice of a career seemed to require an assessment that nobody had written.

3
00:00:16,470 --> 00:00:24,059
“A birth in a village and a degree in the city do not produce the same consciousness,” the director said.

4
00:00:24,059 --> 00:00:31,972
“You have a steady record and a supreme reputation, and now you must decide what it is for.”

5
00:00:31,972 --> 00:00:35,587
The dilemma was polite and fierce at once.

6
00:00:35,587 --> 00:01:00,092
“I appreciate the offer,” Lin said, “but an elegant title is not the same as integrity.” A prospective employer had sent a memo and a memorandum about the modernization of the plant; a second letter mentioned its modernisation in the same breath, and a third asked about neutrality in a dispute the plant had already lost.

7
00:01:00,092 --> 00:01:11,506
The wildlife survey was the reminder of what the group actually owned: a decent dataset, a doubtful forecast, and a dying weather station.

8
00:01:11,506 --> 00:01:17,505
“A reversal of the verdict would require a decisive report,” Maya wrote.

9
00:01:17,505 --> 00:01:24,698
“We can imitate a respectable process and we cannot fake the perseverance behind it.”

10
00:01:24,698 --> 00:01:29,007
The puzzle of the second week was the acidity of the river.

11
00:01:29,007 --> 00:01:35,921
“A permissive rule and a corrupt reading have the same effect on a sample,” the analyst said.

12
00:01:35,921 --> 00:01:46,399
“The difference is who signs it.” Her willpower had carried the survey through a coarse season, and the group had not noticed.

13
00:01:46,399 --> 00:01:52,173
The reproductive data and the urbanisation figures arrived on the same morning.

14
00:01:52,173 --> 00:01:57,532
“We urbanise a district and we call it growth,” the planner said.

15
00:01:57,532 --> 00:02:09,175
“To urbanize is not the same as to improve.” The hesitation in the room was honest, and it was the first useful signal of the whole arc.

16
00:02:09,175 --> 00:02:17,469
The insanity of the summer had been the attempt to do both jobs, and the healthy response was to let one of them go.

17
00:02:17,469 --> 00:02:23,503
“A fire in the building would not require less of us,” the director said.

18
00:02:23,503 --> 00:02:34,266
“It would require the same people, now, with a true answer.” It was a pleasant fortune, and it did not appear by accident.

19
00:02:34,266 --> 00:02:44,459
We had to guess how the production of a survey could fill the role of a job, and we could avoid the fall only by refusing to sell the museum's data.

20
00:02:44,459 --> 00:02:50,936
A sincere sorry would not do; a quiet defiance would.
